    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐβ-άδιον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], τό, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small
			spring</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότιμα λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.913c
				</span></i>
			; <i>small stream</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ὀλεθρίου ὕδατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					8.8.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in the common
			dialect, <i>a wet place</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
