			</span></i>, Thom.Mag.<i><span class="en">
				p.223
			</span></i> R.; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον βοτανῶδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενταύρειον τὸ μικρόν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.68
			</span></i>.</div>
